  == Dressing ==

Combine the dressing ingredients in a #small bowl{}: @extra virgin olive oil{3%Tbsp}, @lemon juice{3%Tbsp}(from 1 large lemon), @garlic clove{1}(pressed or minced), @sea salt{1/2%tsp} and @black pepper{1/8%tsp} and whisk to combine (or shake them together in a small #mason jar{}).

== Salad ==

Combine the remaining chickpea salad ingredients in a #salad bowl{}: @cherry tomatoes{1 1/2%cups}(halved), @English Cucumber{1}(halved and sliced), @chickpeas{15%oz}(drained, rinsed), @red onion{1/2%medium}(thinly sliced), @avocado{1}(sliced), @cilantro{1/4%cup}(chopped) and @feta cheese{4%oz}(diced).

Add the dressing to taste (we used all of it) and toss gently to coat.